    "media:imagetext": "WIEL\nINFLIGHT\n™M\nStay connected to your world with Gogo.\nUse your laptop or any Wi-Fi enabled mobile device to access the Internet if\nyour flight is traveling over the continental United States. Log on and you can\nsurf the web, instant message, email and use your VPN-all at 30,000 feet.\nGogo Inflight Internet Availability\nSpokane\nSeattle O\nPontand o\nBoise\nReno/Lake Tahoe\nO Sacramento\nSan Fran J0900\nOLas Vegas\nLos Angeles O\nLong Beach\nrange Cosprings\n•Phoenix\n• San Diego\n•Tucson\nMinneapolis st Paule\nChicago (O'Hare)e\n• Denver\n•New York City/Newark\n• Washinoon, b.c. Keacan National\nAustin •\n•Dallas/Fort Worth\n• Houston\n• Miam\nAlaska\nInflight Internet service available\nInflight Internet service will be\navailable in early 2011\nAlaska Airlines.\ngogo\nInflight\nInternet\nPlease do not remove this card from aircraft\n2010.05",
